{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1343169-seasonal-courts-and-climate-change","id":1343169,"title":"Seasonal Courts and climate change","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-23T07:31:32-07:00","id":1343169,"title":"Seasonal Courts and climate change","content":"I have question to <b>CtL</b> fans - <b>How do you think that Earth's climate change affects Seasonal Courts dynamics in regions? </b><br /> <br /> For example, in Poland, in Center Europe we now have for few years in official Autumn weather like in Spring ( circa 20 Celsius degree). In Winter we have lately weather like in classical Autumn ( circa 5 Celsius degree). <b>How do you think it affects Seasonal Crowns and exchange of Monarchs powers?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-23-2019, 10:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T08:21:07-07:00","id":1343181,"title":"","content":"pretty good question is,of course i'd argue the seasons that forms the basis of the courts are more than ust temperature nd weather","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T09:31:22-07:00","id":1343196,"title":"","content":"Considering the books have had examples of the Seasonal Courts in places that never had the true four temperate seasons, I think the cultural value of the idealized four seasons is more important than the actual reality in a given location.<br /> <br /> I'd imagine that, over time, if climate change results in cultural change, the Directional Courts are fairly well positioned to take over as the dominant Court system (I mean, by human population distribution they already should be), though you might see local Courts in major cultural centers that are more resonant with a new climate reality get traction and spread fairly quickly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T03:05:43-07:00","id":1343370,"title":"","content":"Also the climate change could be a good ploot hook for a chronicle that revolves around the bad omen of a looming catastrophe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2457,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","user":"Ipergigio","date":". 10-24-2019, 06:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T03:58:28-07:00","id":1343376,"title":"","content":"CtL has enough looming doom I'm not sure that's really as impactful as it could be. You don't want to overload a game with disasters coming over the horizons.<br /> <br /> It could be pretty interesting to seem something like the rise of a new Seasonal Court system that's far more dire in it's thematic elements. The Courts of the Endless Deluge, the Scorching Dust Devil, the Dark Hurricane, and the Polar Vortex that could emerge as Seasons become more about the type of weather disasters that plague the world as climate worsens (Spring = flooding, Summer = tornadoes and drought, Autumn = hurricanes, Winter = blizzards). Then the slow mechanical shift of emotions, and how the Court deal manifest, and so on, even if the general stuff largely remains the same.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T04:09:08-07:00","id":1343377,"title":"","content":"I'd just assume the non-seasonal courts would overtake the seasonal in prevalence eventually.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":".